# 戦女神ZERO's opening: the logo movie, the opening movie skipped by a click, the title, Game Start, the game mode
# (通常) and the first pages of SC0000. It is the scenario of the game's P2 gate (docs/adding-a-game.md, step 6).
# Native AGE and the port both pass it since 2026-11-25, at the same VM positions (native, on a machine with LAV
# Filters, only with the profile's refused classes: tools/drive/bg0.toml). Their title, game-mode and page 4 shots
# are the same to the pixel; page 1's differ only in the turning wait icon's frame.
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game bg0 native|port start
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game bg0 native|port run tools/drive/scenarios/bg0-opening.steps
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game bg0 native|port stop
# LOGO plays LOGO.AGF (an MPEG-1 stream) through op 0x20f with flags 4, then OP plays the opening, which a click ends.
# Game Start calls GAMESTART, whose BUNKI draws the game-mode box (BUNKIMOVE animates it); 通常 goes to SC0000.
# BUNKI's idle loop reads 0x301, its sleep, natively and 0x304 on the port (tools-reference.md, "VM position"), so
# the scenario checks it with script=.
# SC0000's pages draw no op 0x60 random number; the seed is set so that a draw would be the same on both targets.

rand-seed 13
wait-state script=OP timeout=120
wait 3
click adv.next                           # ends the opening movie
wait-state script=TITLE timeout=60
settle timeout=20
shot bg0-opening-title
click title.start
wait-state script=BUNKI timeout=60      # BUNKIMOVE opens the box, then BUNKI idles in sleep 0x1 at 0x301
settle timeout=20
expect script=BUNKI
shot bg0-opening-mode
click mode.normal
wait-state top=SC0000@0xec7 timeout=60   # page 1
settle timeout=20
shot bg0-opening-page1
advance 1
expect top=SC0000@0xefc                  # page 2
advance 1
expect top=SC0000@0x1175                 # page 3
advance 1
expect top=SC0000@0x13e9                 # page 4
shot bg0-opening-page4
advance 1
expect top=SC0000@0x18e1                 # page 5
advance 1
expect top=SC0000@0x1ab3                 # page 6
